					"text": {
						"type": "string",
						"value": "EXAMPLE 1: CREATING A GRADIENT FROM TWO COLORS\n\nThis is the most basic example of the Gradient node.\nWe create two Color In nodes(which we renamed).\nThese colors are used to generated the gradient\nTry changing the colors to see what happens."
